@startuml Sequence Diagram - View Support Status

actor "Customer" as Customer
participant "SupportStatusView" as StatusView
participant "ClerkAuth" as ClerkAuth
participant "Backend" as Backend

Customer -> StatusView : 1 Open support status page
activate StatusView
StatusView -> StatusView : 2 Display support status

StatusView -> ClerkAuth : 3 Request support status
activate ClerkAuth
ClerkAuth -> Backend : 4 Fetch support status
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend : 5 Retrieve support status
Backend -> ClerkAuth : 6 Return status data
ClerkAuth -> StatusView : 7 Return status info
StatusView -> Customer : 8 Display support status

deactivate Backend
deactivate ClerkAuth
deactivate StatusView

@enduml
